$ pda help del
$ pda del --help
Delete one or more keys. Optionally specify a db.

Usage:
  pda del KEY[@DB] [KEY[@DB] ...] [flags]

Aliases:
  del, delete, rm, remove

Flags:
  -f, --force   Force delete without confirmation
  -g, --glob    Treat KEY arguments as glob patterns
  -h, --help    help for del
